yle=\"margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/request-talent/?service=BIM%20Coordinators\">Request BIM Coordinators <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Roles we place</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>BIM Coordinator</li><li>Senior BIM Coordinator</li><li>MEP BIM Coordinator</li><li>Structural BIM Coordinator</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">On the project</p><h2 class=\"h2\">What they <em>do for you.</em></h2></div></div>\n  <div class=\"qual qual-dark\">\n    <div class=\"rv ok\"><p class=\"lab\">Typical responsibilities</p><ul><li>Federate discipline models on shared coordinates</li><li>Run clash tests, group results and assign issues to owners</li><li>Track resolution across model versions</li><li>Check models against the BEP before issue</li><li>Run coordination meetings and maintain issue logs</li></ul></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">Software we assess</p><div class=\"chiprow ink-chips\"><span>Navisworks</span><span>ACC Model Coordination</span><span>Revizto</span><span>Solibri</span><span>Revit</span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"rv\"><p class=\"lab\">How they can work</p><ul class=\"plain\"><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/onsite/\">Onsite BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/remote/\">Remote BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/outsourcing/\">BIM Resource Outsourcing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/dedicated-teams/\">Dedicated BIM Teams</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/staff-augmentation/\">BIM Staff Augmentation</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/mobilization/\">BIM Workforce Mobilization</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/workforce-continuity/\">BIM Workforce Continuity</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/temporary/\">Temporary BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/long-term/\">Long-Term BIM Staffing</a></li><li><a class=\"u\" href=\"/bim-staffing/technical-recruitment/\">BIM Technical Recruitment</a></li></ul></div>\n  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Need a package instead?</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Related <em>BIM services.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/bim-services/\">All BIM services <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-coordination/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Coordination</b><span>Coordination</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/bim-services/bim-qa-qc/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM QA/QC</b><span>Assurance</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">From the portfolio</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Where this work <em>was delivered.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/case-studies/#register\">Portfolio register <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/case-studies/ghadan-21-e25-streetscape/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Ghadan 21 – E25 Streetscape</b><span>Abu Dhabi</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/restaurant-and-fandb-outlet-bim-modeling/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Restaurant &#038; F&#038;B Outlet BIM Modeling</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/hotel-mep-coordination/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>MEP BIM Coordination: Luxury Hotel</b><span>Dubai</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/hotel-resort-landscape/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Hotel &#038; Resort Landscape BIM</b><span>Abu Dhabi</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 400</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies/infrastructure-landscape-and-streetscape-bim/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Infrastructure Landscape &#038; Streetscape BIM</b><span>UAE</span><span class=\"l\">LOD 300</span></a></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"bone pad\"><div class=\"wrap faqx\"><div><p class=\"lab\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Hiring <em>BIM Coordinators.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Anything else? <a class=\"u\" href=\"/contact/\">Ask ENGISOFT.</a></p></div><div class=\"qa\"><details><summary>What does a BIM coordinator deliver each cycle?<i></i></summary><p>Grouped clash reports, viewpoints and an updated issue log in your preferred format.</p></details><details><summary>Can a coordinator join our existing coordination meetings?<i></i></summary><p>Yes. Onsite and remote coordinators work inside your meeting cadence and CDE.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"pad\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n  <div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Other disciplines</p><h2 class=\"h2\">More <em>professionals.</em></h2></div><a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"/engineering-staffing/\">Engineering staffing <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div>\n  <ul class=\"rel\"><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/bim-architects/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>BIM Architects</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/architectural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Architectural BIM Engineers</b><span>Architecture</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/structural-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>Structural BIM Engineers</b><span>Structure</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/mep-bim-engineers/\" style=\"display:contents\"><b>MEP BIM Engineers</b><span>MEP</span><span class=\"l\">&rarr;</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/engineering-staffing/mechanica